      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Let's repair this one.\n\nA simple average would work only for equal quantities. Here the ₹32 lot is three times as large.\n\nTotal cost ₹1200 for 40 kg, so mean C.P. = ₹30/kg.\n\nNow use the same idea with fresh values.",
